{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"661d105b-7ca7-45ed-9e03-98464a0232cf","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have written the full audit to [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Key Findings\n\nWhile [20261010040000_normal_forms.sql](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/migrations/20261010040000_normal_forms.sql) cleaned up the initial schema (dropping `idea_items.person_id`, `document_chunks.{kind, source_url, source_ref, label}`, and `plans.allowed_models`, converting `documents.is_public` and `drafts.tokens_in`/`tokens_out` to generated columns, and adding composite FKs and triggers), several unenforced 1NF/2NF/3NF and derived-column issues either entered in subsequent migrations (`20261011010000`–`20261015010000`) or remain from earlier migrations:\n\n1. **2NF (\"the whole key\"):**\n   - `idea_items.quote` ([20261008230200_backend_v1.sql](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/migrations/20261008230200_backend_v1.sql#L90-L98)): `idea_items` is keyed by `(idea_id, item_id)`, but `quote` is `firstSentence(items.text, 220)` ([ideas.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/core/ideas.ts#L58-L68)), which depends on `item_id` alone (and [github/index.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/github/index.ts#L239) already reads `r.items!.text` first).\n\n2. **3NF — Copies of a parent without composite FKs:**\n   - `code_questions.project_id` vs `items.project_id` ([20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/migrations/20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql#L56-L60)): copies `items.project_id` when `item_id` is set ([ask-code/index.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/ask-code/index.ts#L29-L32)), with no composite FK `(item_id, project_id) references items (id, project_id)`.\n   - `model_calls.{project_id, item_id, founder_id}` ([20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/migrations/20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql#L15-L24)): copies `items.project_id` (when `item_id` is set) and `code_questions.{project_id, item_id, asked_by}` (when `run_id` is set) without composite FKs, and duplicates `drafts` rows via backfill.\n   - `document_chunks.{published_at, published_precision}` ([knowledge.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/server/knowledge.ts#L87-L108)): `storeDocs` writes the parent `documents` date and precision identically onto every chunk.\n   - `touches` ([store.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/core/store.ts#L89-L94), [20261011010000_draft_checks.sql](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/migrations/20261011010000_draft_checks.sql#L61-L63), [github/index.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/github/index.ts#L331-L335)) and `voice_samples` ([20261010010000_sources_voice_knowledge.sql](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/migrations/20261010010000_sources_voice_knowledge.sql#L82-L104)): copy `platform`, `url`, `text`, and timestamps from `items`, `drafts`, and `ideas`.\n\n3. **3NF — Transitive dependencies within a row (`key → non-key → non-key`):**\n   - `projects.{github_board_id, github_board_owner, github_board_number, github_board_title}` ([20261014010000_github_board_results.sql](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/migrations/20261014010000_github_board_results.sql#L17-L24)): `projects.id → github_board_id ↔ (github_board_owner, github_board_number) → github_board_title`.\n   - `ideas.{github_issue_repo, github_issue_number, github_issue_url, github_issue_state, github_issue_state_reason, github_issue_closed_at, github_board_status, github_checked_at}` ([20261014010000_github_board_results.sql](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/migrations/20261014010000_github_board_results.sql#L27-L38)): issue state attributes depend on `(github_issue_repo, github_issue_number)` rather than `ideas.id`.\n   - `github_installations.{account_id, account_login, account_type}` ([20261010030000_github_app.sql](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/migrations/20261010030000_github_app.sql#L9-L21)) and `items.my_post` ([20261008170000_init.sql](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/migrations/20261008170000_init.sql#L154)).\n\n4. **Hand-written derived values (same-row \u0026 cross-row):**\n   - `model_calls.{tokens_in, tokens_out, cost_usd}` vs `model_calls.usage` ([20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/migrations/20261015010000_ask_code_model_calls.sql#L28-L31), [models.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/server/models.ts#L46-L50), [ask_code.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/server/ask_code.ts#L88-L93)) — reintroduces the hand-written token totals that were converted to generated columns on `drafts`.\n   - `code_questions.{steps, usage, cost_usd}` vs `model_calls` rows with `run_id = code_questions.id` ([ask_code.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/server/ask_code.ts#L95-L107)): `cost_usd` duplicates `usage-\u003e\u003e'cost_usd'`, and on failed runs `ask_code.ts` updates `cost_usd` via read-then-write while leaving `steps` and `usage` as `null`.\n   - `drafts.checks` ([draft_run.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/core/draft_run.ts#L173)), `items.triage` on `origin = 'discover'` items ([triage_run.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/core/triage_run.ts#L33-L58)), `voice_samples.{quality, status, reason, text_sha256}` ([voice.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/core/sources/voice.ts#L93-L101)), `document_chunks.{content_sha256, tokens}` and `documents.content` ([knowledge.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/server/knowledge.ts#L90-L108)), and `projects.landing` ([read-landing/index.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/read-landing/index.ts#L75-L80)).\n\n5. **1NF (relations/keys in JSONB or composite strings searched inside):**\n   - `github_installations.repos` ([github.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/server/github.ts#L152-L161)), `drafts.sources` ([draft_run.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/core/draft_run.ts#L170-L172)), `touches.meta-\u003e\u003e'external_id'` ([store.ts](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/functions/_shared/core/store.ts#L124)), and `source_syncs.source` / `state-\u003e\u003e'branch'` ([20261010020000_source_summary_branch.sql](file:///tmp/h-TC7Atj/supabase/migrations/20261010020000_source_summary_branch.sql#L20-L21)).\n","duration_seconds":876.683698,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":242399,"output_tokens":60018,"thinking_tokens":39976,"cache_read_tokens":2384325,"total_tokens":302417}}}
